# Keep shell scripts and Functions runtime config files using LF line
# endings on all platforms. Without this, Windows checkouts with
# `core.autocrlf=true` corrupt `*.sh` so they fail under Git Bash / WSL,
# and `host.json` / `local.settings.json` style files come back with
# CRLF that some tooling chokes on.
*.sh         text eol=lf
*.bash       text eol=lf
host*.json   text eol=lf
local.settings*.json* text eol=lf
